$ A CQUAD4 whose continuation line has T1-T4 all blank: the element uses the PSHELL T (0.1). A unit square in uniform
$ tension (unit total load on the free edge, the other edge held in x, lateral contraction free) must stretch
$ u = P L / (E t w) = 1 * 1 / (7.E4 * 0.1 * 1) = 1.4285714E-4. Reading the blank Ti as 0 stops the run (ERROR 1949).
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = CQUAD4 WITH BLANK T1-T4 ON ITS CONTINUATION
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
DISP = ALL
BEGIN BULK
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.,,3456
GRID,2,,1.,0.,0.,,3456
GRID,3,,1.,1.,0.,,3456
GRID,4,,0.,1.,0.,,3456
CQUAD4,1,1,1,2,3,4,,,+C1
+C1,,,,,,
PSHELL,1,1,0.1,1,,1
MAT1,1,7.E4,,0.3
SPC1,1,12,1
SPC1,1,1,4
FORCE,1,2,,0.5,1.,0.,0.
FORCE,1,3,,0.5,1.,0.,0.
ENDDATA
